1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,841
The anode is a thick plate of impure blister copper.

2
00:00:03,841 --> 00:00:07,200
The cathode is a thin sheet of pure copper.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:12,083
The electrolyte is copper sulphate acidified with sulphuric acid.

4
00:00:12,083 --> 00:00:19,401
As current flows, the anode dissolves as copper ions, and pure copper deposits on the cathode.

